WEBVTT

00:12:57.360 --> 00:13:01.758
(Clapping)

00:13:01.758 --> 00:13:04.902
(Clapping)

00:13:04.902 --> 00:13:07.805
Okay, how about if everyone over there shouts. One, two, three?

00:13:07.805 --> 00:13:10.706
Audience: (Shouts)

00:13:10.706 --> 00:13:15.152
(Laughter)

00:13:15.152 --> 00:13:18.323
(Shouts) (Laughter)

00:13:18.323 --> 00:13:21.964
Brilliant. Now, open your eyes. We'll do it one more time.

00:13:21.964 --> 00:13:24.766
Everyone over there shout. (Shouts)

00:13:24.766 --> 00:13:30.698
Where's the sound coming from? (Laughter) (Applause)